Source: udt
Section: libs
Priority: optional
Maintainer: Dmitry Musatov <dm@dgma.io>
Build-Depends: debhelper-compat (= 13)
Standards-Version: 4.7.0
Rules-Requires-Root: no
Homepage: https://github.com/dorkbox/UDT

Package: libudt0
Architecture: amd64
Multi-Arch: same
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Description: UDP-based data transfer library
 UDT is a reliable, connection-oriented transport protocol on top of UDP for
 bulk transfer over long, fast links. It has its own loss recovery and
 congestion control, which an application can replace with its own.
 .
 This is UDT 4.13, the dorkbox tree of UDT 4.11 with its fixes: a flush
 call, two epoll helpers and a timer that falls back to the system clock. It
 keeps libudt.so.0, and takes the place of the library of the same name in
 Debian's udt source package.

Package: libudt-dev
Section: libdevel
Architecture: amd64
Multi-Arch: same
Depends: libudt0 (= ${binary:Version}), ${misc:Depends}
Description: UDP-based data transfer library - development files
 Headers, the static library and the libudt.so link for building programs
 against UDT. The headers are installed under /usr/include/udt.
